    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13147" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολυτρ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>release on payment of ransom,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				21
			</span></i>: c. gen. pretii, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἐχθροὺς ἀ. τῶν μακροτάτων λύτρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					919a
				</span></i>
			, cf. Philipp. ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				12.3
			</span></i>; <i>restore for a ransom,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐλεύθερα σώματα καὶ τὴν πόλιν
					αὐτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.6.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.14.1
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				5.40
			</span></i>.</div>
